{
  "title": "ENI · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "VPC 안의 논리적 탄력적 네트워크 인터페이스다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#primary-network-interface\">Primary Network Interface</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#secondary-network-interface\">Secondary Network Interface</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#private-and-public-ip-addresses\">Private and Public IP Addresses</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#security-group-and-mac-address\">Security Group and MAC Address</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#source-destination-check\">Source/Destination Check</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#requester-managed-network-interface\">Requester-managed Network Interface</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#prefix-delegation-and-efa\">Prefix Delegation and EFA</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>24 / 62</span></div><h1>ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Elastic Network Interface는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>의 가상 Network Card를 나타내는 리소스다. IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> Address, MAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Media Access Control)</span> Address, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>과 Attachment 등 네트워크 속성을 묶는다.</p><p>물리 서버의 카드와 동일한 장치를 직접 조작하는 것은 아니다. ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>의 속성을 유지한 채 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>로 이동하면 해당 주소를 사용하는 통신 경로도 새 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>로 바뀔 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"ENI에 포함되는 네트워크 Identity\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>ENI에 포함되는 네트워크 Identity</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Attachment</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Subnet</strong><small>한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 주소 공간</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span></strong><small>Private IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>·MAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Media Access Control)</span>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> in same <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></strong><small>Network Interface 연결</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Secondary ENI</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Secondary ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span></strong><small>지원 주소·설정 보존</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Detach / Attach</strong><small>지원 Instance로 이동</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Failover pattern</strong><small>앱 상태·권한도 별도 처리</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Primary ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>와 Secondary ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>의 분리·이동 조건은 다르다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"primary-network-interface\"><h2>Primary Network Interface<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#primary-network-interface\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 시작 시 기본으로 사용하는 ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>다. 실행 중인 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>에서 Primary ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>를 분리할 수 없다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>의 종료 시 ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span> 삭제 여부는 DeleteOnTermination 설정과 리소스 유형에 따라 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"secondary-network-interface\"><h2>Secondary Network Interface<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#secondary-network-interface\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>추가 ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>를 연결해 관리·데이터 트래픽을 구분하거나 Network Appliance를 구성할 수 있다. ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span> 개수와 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> 개수는 Instance Type별 제한을 받는다. 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에서 생성한 ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>를 붙일 수 없다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"private-and-public-ip-addresses\"><h2>Private and Public IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> Addresses<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#private-and-public-ip-addresses\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Primary·Secondary Private IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>와 IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> 주소를 사용할 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a>는 Private IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>에 연결되는 별도 Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 리소스다. 여러 ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>를 붙였다고 OS가 모든 경로를 자동으로 원하는 방향으로 선택하지는 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"security-group-and-mac-address\"><h2>Security Group and MAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Media Access Control)</span> Address<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#security-group-and-mac-address\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>가 가진 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>과 MAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Media Access Control)</span> 등 속성은 ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>를 다시 연결해도 유지된다. 따라서 서버 교체 시 네트워크 Identity 유지에 활용할 수 있다. 서비스 관리 ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>에는 사용자가 변경할 수 없는 속성이 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"source-destination-check\"><h2>Source/Destination Check<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#source-destination-check\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>기본적으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>는 자신이 출발지 또는 목적지인 트래픽을 처리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#nat-instance\">NAT Instance</a>, Router, Firewall처럼 타 리소스의 패킷을 중계할 때 Check를 비활성화해야 한다. Route와 보안 규칙도 함께 구성해야 중계가 가능하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"requester-managed-network-interface\"><h2>Requester-managed Network Interface<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#requester-managed-network-interface\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a>, Load Balancer 등 서비스가 생성·관리하는 ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>가 있다. 임의로 분리·변경하면 안 되며 서비스의 관리 경로를 따른다. 관리 주체가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 사용자인지 서비스인지 구분해 문제를 조사한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"prefix-delegation-and-efa\"><h2>Prefix Delegation and EFA <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Fabric Adapter)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#prefix-delegation-and-efa\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#prefix-delegation-and-efa\">Prefix Delegation</a>은 개별 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> 대신 주소 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Prefix</a>를 ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>에 할당한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#prefix-delegation-and-efa\">Elastic Fabric Adapter</a>는 지원 Instance의 HPC <span class=\"full-name\">(High Performance Computing)</span>·분산 통신에 사용된다. 일반 ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#prefix-delegation-and-efa\">EFA</a>의 지원 타입·연결 제한은 별도로 확인한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 대기 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>로 Secondary ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>를 옮겨 Private IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>를 유지할 수 있지만, 이것만으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 전체 장애에 대비하는 것은 아니다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>ENI <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Network Interface)</span>는 실제 서버에 꽂힌 물리 랜 카드와 같지 않다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/using-eni.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/using-eni.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q012/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q012\" data-question=\"Q012\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q012</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q012/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which logical networking resource associated with an EC2 instance includes IP addresses and security groups?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>에는 프라이빗 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a> 등의 네트워크 속성이 연결된다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q018\" data-question=\"Q018\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q018</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q018/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company creates an ENI with a private IP address in a private subnet to access an AWS service. Which endpoint type is this?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q018\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q018\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A transit gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q018\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q018\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An interface endpoint</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 인터페이스 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\">PrivateLink</a> 기반 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>에 만든다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q009\" data-question=\"Q009\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q009</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a public subnet must receive requests directly from internet clients. Which combination is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only an S3 gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a route to a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A route to an internet gateway, a public address, and permissive security rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a private IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>로 향하는 경로와 외부에서 도달할 주소, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>/<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a> 허용이 함께 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q016\" data-question=\"Q016\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q016</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q016/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance must retain the same public IPv4 address after it restarts. Which resource should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q016\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 Access Point</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q016\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A change to the ENI MAC address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q016\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q016\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS PrivateLink</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">EIP</a>는 계정에 할당하는 고정 공인 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 주소다. 비용과 장애 조치 설계는 별개다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q017\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">이전 용어 <b>ELB / ALB / NLB</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">다음 용어 <b>EventBridge</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
